- WATERMARK: The image contains a watermark.
- COLOR_PRINT: The image is a color print or copy.
- WEB_IMAGE: The image is a web image.
- SAME_FACE: The face is similar to another face.
- SAME_BACKGROUND: The background is similar to another background.', example='PS,SCREEN_PHOTO'),
    verifyDetail?: string(name='VerifyDetail', description='The authoritative verification details.', example='**'),
    verifyResult?: string(name='VerifyResult', description='The authoritative verification result.', example='*'),
    vlResult?: {
      success?: boolean(name='Success', description='Indicates whether the Qwen explanation is successful. Valid values:

