- The accessibility of this URL is verified before the API is invoked. If the specified URL does not support public network access, a 400 error is returned.
- The callback is executed immediately after the OCR recognition is invoked, but may be delayed due to network or other issues. Accept the request completion notification on the client side first, and then invoke the query API to obtain the result details.', example='https://www.aliyun.com?callbackToken=100000****&certifyId=shaxxxx&subCode=200', position='Body'),
