This parameter is required.', example='IDENTITY_CARD', position='Body'),
  docScanMode?: string(name='DocScanMode', description='The OCR identity document scanning pattern. Valid values:
- shoot: takes a photo. This is the default value.
- scan: scans the document.
- auto: automatic switchover between photo and scan patterns.', example='shoot', position='Body'),
  idSpoof?: string(name='IdSpoof', description='Specifies whether to enable the anti-counterfeiting detection feature for the identity document. Valid values:
- Y: Enabled.
- N: Disabled. This is the default value.', example='Y', position='Body'),
