<notice>

- The callback is triggered only when the authentication is completed, including both successful and failed authentications. If the authentication is abandoned, an abnormal break occurs, or the authentication is not performed, no notification is sent. We recommend that you invoke the query API operation to obtain the authentication details after you receive the callback notification if needed.
- The accessibility of the URL is verified before the API operation is invoked. If the URL does not support public network access, a 401 error is returned.
- The API operation must return HTTP status code 200 after the callback. Otherwise, a retry is triggered, and two callbacks are sent within 3 seconds.

</notice>', example='https://www.aliyun.com', position='Query'),
  cameraSelection?: string(name='CameraSelection', description='Specifies whether to enable the camera selection feature. Valid values:

- **Y**: Enables the feature.

- **N**: Does not enable the feature. This is the default value.

> This feature takes effect only in the PC integration mode. After this feature is enabled, users can select a camera for authentication.', example='N', position='Query'),
  certName?: string(name='CertName', description='The real name.', example='Zhang San', position='Query'),
  certNo?: string(name='CertNo', description='The ID document number.', example='330103xxxxxxxxxxxx', position='Query'),
  certType?: string(name='CertType', description='The type of the ID document.

Only ID cards are supported. Set the value to IDENTITY_CARD.', example='IDENTITY_CARD', position='Query'),
  certifyId?: string(name='CertifyId', description='**[Deprecated]**

The CertifyId of a previous successful ID Verification. The photo used in the previous authentication is used as the comparison photo.

> You can specify only one of the following parameters to pass the image: FaceContrastPicture, FaceContrastPictureUrl, CertifyId, and OSS.', example='0bfa7c493f850e5178b9f8613634c9xx', position='Query'),
  certifyUrlStyle?: string(name='CertifyUrlStyle', description='The type of the returned **CertifyUrl**. Valid values:

- **L**: Original long URL.

- **S** (default): Short URL.', example='L', position='Query'),
  certifyUrlType?: string(name='CertifyUrlType', description='The device type of the Web SDK. Valid values: **WEB** and **H5**.

> Only Web SDK device types are supported.', example='WEB', position='Query'),
  crop?: string(name='Crop', description='Specifies whether to allow face image cropping. By default, cropping is not allowed. Valid values:

- T: Cropping is allowed.

- F: Cropping is not allowed.

> If the requested image is not collected by the standard liveness detection SDK, we recommend that you allow face image cropping. After this feature is enabled, the requested image is cropped and corrected before the request is sent to the service.', example='T', position='Body'),
  enableAlbumUpload?: string(name='EnableAlbumUpload', description='Specifies whether to allow album upload. Valid values: Y and N. Default value: N.', example='Y', position='Query'),
  enableBeauty?: string(name='EnableBeauty', description='Specifies whether to enable the beauty filter. Valid values: Y and N.', example='Y', position='Query'),
  enableTts?: string(name='EnableTts', description='Specifies whether to enable speech synthesis for H5 willingness authentication. Valid values: Y and N. Default value: Y.', example='Y', position='Query'),
  encryptType?: string(name='EncryptType', description='The encryption algorithm. Only the SM2 algorithm is supported.

After encrypted transmission is enabled, you must pass the encrypted CertName and CertNo. For more information about encryption, see [Parameter encryption](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/id-verification/financial-grade-id-verification/description-of-parameter-encryption#task-2229332).', example='SM2', position='Query'),
  faceContrastPicture?: string(name='FaceContrastPicture', description='The Base64-encoded image.

